model g8_flows_before
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  note "T, tally 2.1.2 (issue #38), G8: E §4.3 step 1, L §5.14.1: a projection's walk continues the walk it starts from, so flows of a place over a span starting before the projection's first day counts what that walk booked before it. top tops konto's inflows since y0 up to cap on the 15th of each month: 900.00 PLN in January, after pay's 100.00, and never again. Projected from 2026-06-01 (q_june), top on 2026-06-15 reads flows(konto, 2026-01-01 .. 2026-06-15) = 1 500.00 PLN, January to May from the main walk and June's pay from the projection's, so it books 0, and q_june = 2 100.00 PLN, the main walk's figure (main) and that of a projection from the run's first day (q_start), which counts every day itself. tally 2.1.1 summed only the projection's own log (100.00 PLN), booked 900.00 PLN again and printed q_june: 3 000.00 PLN."

source fixture "T's fixture for S's kernel tests (invented values)"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

input cap: money PLN

input wage: money PLN

input dom: int

input y0: date

place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..

move pay[m in months]: transfers
  on start_of(m)
  at start_of(m)
  leg cash from world to konto amount wage

move top[m in months]: transfers
  on day_of(m, dom)
  at start_of(m)
  reads konto
  leg cash from world to konto amount max(0 PLN, cap - flows(konto, y0 .. day_of(m, dom)))

ask main: bal(konto, 2026-12-31)

ask q_june: bal(konto, 2026-12-31) from 2026-06-01

ask q_start: bal(konto, 2026-12-31) from 2026-01-01

version facts
  cite fixture
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  cap = 1 000.00 PLN
  wage = 100.00 PLN
  dom = 15
  y0 = 2026-01-01
  opening[konto] = 0 PLN at 2026-01-01 start
